layout_mode = 2
tooltip_text = "Displays information about the engine:

Disabled - No information

Simple - Current Engine Power and
small engine power curve are displayed.

Full - Current Engine Power and Torque,
Peak Engine Power and Torque, and detailed
engine torque/power graph is displayed.

Disclaimer:
Parts of the power curve may be incomplete
if the power hasn't been properly sampled
throughout the entire rev-range."

